# Word's lock file while the report is open. It is a live handle, not content.
~$*.docx
~$*.doc

# Packet Tracer working files and autosaves. The repository carries the
# paste-ready IOS configs instead: a .pkt is a binary that only opens in one
# version of one tool, and nobody can review a diff of it.
*.pkt
*.pka
*.pkt.bak

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
